<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/15fb1774e179927cb8cf32c70126105ee4018d93#visit> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/tree-sitter/tree-sitter/v0.25/core/text> "def visit(self, node, *args, **kwargs):\n        node_type = node['type']\n        method = self._method_cache.get(node_type)\n        if method is None:\n            method = getattr(\n                self, 'visit_%s' % node['type'], self.default_visit)\n            self._method_cache[node_type] = method\n        return method(node, *args, **kwargs)" <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/15fb1774e179927cb8cf32c70126105ee4018d93> .
