<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/15fb1774e179927cb8cf32c70126105ee4018d93#_is_actual_number> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/tree-sitter/tree-sitter/v0.25/core/text> "def _is_actual_number(x):\n    # We need to handle python's quirkiness with booleans,\n    # specifically:\n    #\n    # >>> isinstance(False, int)\n    # True\n    # >>> isinstance(True, int)\n    # True\n    if isinstance(x, bool):\n        return False\n    return isinstance(x, Number)" <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/15fb1774e179927cb8cf32c70126105ee4018d93> .
