<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/15fb1774e179927cb8cf32c70126105ee4018d93#visit_not_expression> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/tree-sitter/tree-sitter/v0.25/core/text> "def visit_not_expression(self, node, value):\n        original_result = self.visit(node['children'][0], value)\n        if _is_actual_number(original_result) and original_result == 0:\n            # Special case for 0, !0 should be false, not true.\n            # 0 is not a special cased integer in jmespath.\n            return False\n        return not original_result" <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/15fb1774e179927cb8cf32c70126105ee4018d93> .
