<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/15fb1774e179927cb8cf32c70126105ee4018d93#_visit> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/tree-sitter/tree-sitter/v0.25/core/text> "def _visit(self, node, current):\n        self._lines.append('%s [label=\"%s(%s)\"]' % (\n            current, node['type'], node.get('value', '')))\n        for child in node.get('children', []):\n            child_name = '%s%s' % (child['type'], self._count)\n            self._count += 1\n            self._lines.append('  %s -> %s' % (current, child_name))\n            self._visit(child, child_name)" <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/15fb1774e179927cb8cf32c70126105ee4018d93> .
